{'symbol': 'HCA', 'date': '2023-04-28 08:30:00', 'title': 'HCA HEALTHCARE MOBILIZES VOLUNTEERS FOR APRIL COMMUNITY DAYS MONTH OF SERVICE', 'text': "NASHVILLE, TENN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HCA HEALTHCARE, INC. (NYSE:HCA), ONE OF THE NATION'S LEADING HEALTHCARE PROVIDERS, TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS FOURTH ANNUAL MONTH-LONG COMMUNITY VOLUNTEER CAMPAIGN, COMMUNITY DAYS: A MONTH OF SERVICE. DURING THE MONTH OF APRIL, HCA HEALTHCARE IS PROVIDING VOLUNTEER TIME AND FINANCIAL CONTRIBUTIONS TO MORE THAN 350 NOT-FOR-PROFIT, CHARITABLE ORGANIZATIONS IN MIDDLE TENNESSEE, CORRESPONDING WITH NATIONAL VOLUNTEER APPRECIATION MONTH. “WHILE VOLUNTEERING OCCURS THROUGHO."}